For a combination of lenses in contact, the effective power \(P_{eq}\) is the sum of the individual powers \(P_i\) of the lenses. Since all 5 lenses are identical, their individual focal lengths \(f\) and powers \(P\) are the same.
P_{eq} = P_1 + P_2 + P_3 + P_4 + P_5
